{"c":"421085","n":"ŽELIVKA 6 - NÁDRŽ SEDLICE","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"Humpolec","url":"421085-zelivka-6-nadrz-sedlice","stav":"2026-10-05","popis":"Přítok Sázavy. Od tělesa údolní nádrže Sedlice až k jezu Hrobského mlýna v k. ú. Kletečná. K revíru patří úsek Hejlovky (GPS Z: 49°29'59.556\"N, 15°15'34.558\"E, K: 49°29'35.013\"N, 15°15'4.228\"E) od jejího vtoku do údolní nádrže až k jezu Břečovského mlýna v k. ú. Svépravice. Lov z plavidel a zavážení návnad a nástrah povoleny. Zákaz používání vábniček. Hlubinná přívlač je zakázána. Lov ryb povolen i v přítokových úsecích nádrže. Zákaz rybolovu na sjezdu do vody a v úseku 10 m od něj (GPS 49°30'45.873\"N, 15°15'52.508\"E). Jelec jesen a mník jednovousý jsou celoročně hájeni.","delka":4,"rozloha":38,"lat":49.503781,"lon":15.2641,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/humpolec","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"humpolec@mo.jcus.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podh